  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safe and Resilient Schools is a Government of Tonga and World Bank led program to enhance the safety and resilience of education facilities across the Kingdom and to improve the quality of data-driven education management and curricula. Australia&apos;s funding is earmarked to the infrastructure component of the project.</narrative>
